	// - Additional HP: we need enough HP to survive t_kill seconds.

	// Let's set reasonable upper bounds.
	// Max ATK needed: DEFM + HPM (to kill in 1 hit) is enough, but let's go a bit higher to be safe.
	// Actually, if ATKY + addATK > DEFM, damage per second = ATKY + addATK - DEFM.
	// t_kill = ceil(HPM / (ATKY + addATK - DEFM))
